JOB INPUT W41837D1 START INIT-PROC                                              
                                                                                
    W-IDDISTR         = RP-IDDISTR                                              
    W-IDKUNDNR        = RP-IDKUNDNR                                             
    W-IDRAPPNR        = RP-IDRAPPNR                                             
